      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JEWEL HEAVEN (5) has been racing in the city and producing some good results including a win last month. Backs up after she was held up and beaten only 4.3m at Menangle on Saturday and won the last time she raced here so looks well placed. YUKON BE SERIOUS NZ (4) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 4 metres from the winner in fourth in a higher-graded race at Wagga. Came from this barrier for a 2.1m third there prior. This suits. SHAZADELE (1) added to a string of top-four results at this venue when runner-up last week and should get her chance from the ace draw. RIKIBREAL (2) drew wide last time but came from this barrier for second in her previous two outings here.",
